"заново\n"
"  с причиной на его странице."
msgstr ""
"Payroll is approved through %(edge)s inclusive. Edits that would change\n"
"  the calculation for these months — rate, group scheme, standard hours — "
"will be rejected:\n"
"  the payroll sheet for them is already in hand. To fix it anyway, reopen "
"the month\n"
"  with a reason on its page."

